o Order data class\n- ApiError.kt — Added ORDER_HAS_CONFIRMED_SHIPMENT and ORDER_IS_CANCELLED error codes\n- ShipmentRepository.kt — Added findByOrderId method to retrieve shipments by order\n- OrderController.kt — Added ShipmentRepository dependency, updated create to set ACTIVE status, added POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel endpoint\n- ShipmentController.kt — Added OrderRepository dependency and cancelled order check before shipment creation\n- OrderControllerTest.kt — Added 5 tests for cancellation scenarios (active, with created shipments, idempotent, with confirmed shipment, non-existent)\n- ShipmentControllerTest.kt — Added 1 test for shipment creation on cancelled order\n\nTests:\n- cancels an active order and returns 200 with cancelled status\n- cancels an order with only created shipments (validates shipments also transition to CANCELLED)\n- cancelling a cancelled order succeeds (idempotent)\n- returns 409 if order has a confirmed shipment (validates nothing changes)\n- returns 404 when cancelling a non-existent order\n- returns 409 when creating a shipment for a cancelled order\n\nVerification: Ran `./mvnw test` from sample-service/ — BUILD SUCCESS, 19 tests run (9 in OrderControllerTest, 6 in ShipmentControllerTest, 1 in SampleServiceApplicationTests, 3 in CustomerControllerTest), all passed, 0 failures.\n\nNot done: Nothing — all acceptance criteria implemented and verified."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3366,"cache_read_input_tokens":33453,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3366},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b9d5bac5-ee18-49f2-8c23-0f2e830ccfc9","uuid":"6ca05c22-7d80-4675-9197-d5c65ebec335","timestamp":"2026-09-10T20:46:44.907Z","request_id":"req_011CevQwyT3rwye9YSXTuAFi"}
